  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">WomHub - Moving Women in mining into Circularity</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WomHub- Moving Women in mining into Circularity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Support women in mining  to leverage Circularity in the value chain, bridges the critical gap between sustainability and gender equality. 30 female entrepreneurs will be targeted , to bring circularity into the business. The programme aims to create awareness and opportunities around women in the mining sector and leveraging circularity for success . This event and education campaigns will run at the inception of the project as well as culminating with a side event at the mining indaba in Cape Town. The projects aims to empower women to redefine mining future.</narrative>
